[agent:result]         4→gradient descent (learning rate 0.1, exactly 300 iterations, weights and bias
[agent:result]         5→initialized to zero) and writes predictions.csv with columns row_id, score
[agent:result]         6→(rounded to 6 decimals). Fully deterministic — do NOT modify it; run it as-is.
[agent:result]         7→"""
[agent:result]         8→import numpy as np
[agent:result]         9→import pandas as pd
[agent:result]        10→
[agent:result]        11→FEATURES = ["f1", "f2", "f3", "f4", "f5"]
